  "title": "Nerdy Announces Fourth Quarter 2025 Financial Results",
  "summary": "Nerdy returns to year-over-year revenue growth and delivers positive non-GAAP Adjusted EBITDA in Q4 2025, beating guidance on both metrics and demonstrating significant improvement in the Company’s cost structure. Nerdy completes replatforming and launch of its Live+AI™ platform using AI-native coding during the fourth quarter, providing the Company with significant momentum as we enter 2026. Nerdy Inc. (NYSE: NRDY) today announced financial results for the fourth quarter and year ended December",
